Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:08.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So then, have you made up \Nyour mind to take the exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:11.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course! I can even wag my tail too if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.06,0:00:14.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.58,0:00:20.46,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,From now on, you two will apply yourself to \Nyour studies wherever you feel is most suitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:22.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"The Sewing Life Alchemist"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:24.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shou Tucker—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:27.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the foremost authority on transmuting living bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:35.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, we came to spend the remaining time before our exam at the Tucker house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.87,0:00:40.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.58,0:00:45.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.85,0:00:50.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.71,0:02:48.48,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Mr. Tucker successfully transmuted \Na Chimera that could speak man's language.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:51.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He has taken the State Alchemist Certification Examination as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:54.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Chimera that speaks man's language?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:58.94,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,It was a composite beast that was created at the cost of multiple creatures that had differing genetics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.25,0:03:03.32,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,Or, to put it another way, a Chimera that could understand what a person says and could speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.32,0:03:05.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.07,0:03:10.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Tucker also lives with his daughter, who is about to turn four.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:12.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then he doesn't have a wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:14.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:20.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:22.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible, huh, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:26.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? \NCome over here, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:36.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:41.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't do that, you know, Alexander!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:43.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.27,0:03:47.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're Tucker-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.40,0:03:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm terribly sorry about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:52.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have any woman's touch around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.36,0:03:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like this inside the house too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:04:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow. Bigger Brother's clothes are funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:04.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't they heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.36,0:04:08.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right. \NBig Brother is very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:18.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll have a chance to \Ndiscuss their natures at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:20.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Until you do, just accept them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:25.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, Nina, go play outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:29.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alexander must be lonesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:42.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought you'd aspire to be State Alchemists at your ages?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:47.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there's anything I can do for you, \Njust let me know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Tucker-san, I'd like to have you \Nshow us the Chimera you transmuted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:52.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:59.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it died not long after \Nit was transmuted, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:03.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyways, passing marks come first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.58,0:05:06.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will take more than just an \Novernight effort to pass this test.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:15.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the materials room. You're free to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:19.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is incredible, Brother. \NIt's full of books I've never even seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.60,0:05:21.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The materials in here are just a fraction
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.35,0:05:24.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,compared to what they have \Nat the National Central Library.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.44,0:05:27.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you pass the test, you can get \Nmaterials that will give you dozens—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:31.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,no, hundreds of times \Nmore knowledge than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.13,0:05:32.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.38,0:05:35.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, we should get busy—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:41.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed-kun, are you making any progress with your studies?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:48.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, some.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:51.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there's so much stuff here that I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.77,0:05:56.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The test is hard even for adults who have received special education.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:05:58.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you're still so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:00.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to force yourself to \Nworry about it this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.82,0:06:01.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:04.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll try to do everything that I can,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.58,0:06:07.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,no matter how slim the \Npossibilities are of me passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.22,0:06:10.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I can keep moving ahead...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.05,0:06:15.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bigger Brother, \Nyou haven't eaten anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:19.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That won't do! You have to make sure to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:21.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:24.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.64,0:06:26.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This sure does look delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:28.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be sure you chew it well!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.02,0:06:30.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:32.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This sure is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:34.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here! Have another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.47,0:06:39.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:43.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. My head is too full of all the things I learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:44.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:46.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.71,0:06:51.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll be able \Nto pass the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:53.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you should at least get a good night's rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.50,0:06:58.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sure takes me back, the way this all feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:04.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The two of us wanted nothing \Nbut to become State Alchemists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:09.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once we did, we felt that some kind of path would become open to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:18.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no, is it this late already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.86,0:07:22.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.16,0:07:26.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he off playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.56,0:07:31.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:34.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Little Big Brother, it snowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:54.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:59.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish you could stay here all the time \Nafter you pass your test.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brother, what are you drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:10.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's called a transmutation circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.70,0:08:12.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an incantation to get a wish granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:14.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.66,0:08:16.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:26.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible! Big Brother, \Nthat was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.90,0:08:28.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.45,0:08:31.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major Hughes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:33.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey there! I've come to pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's your birthday today, right, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.08,0:08:37.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:40.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How would you know \Nsomething like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.74,0:08:43.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}am{\i0} with the research department, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.27,0:08:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go to my house. My wife is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.30,0:08:49.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You too there, little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:53.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A celebration is more fun \Nif you share it with everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:57.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:08:59.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you all for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.38,0:09:00.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my wife, Gracia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:02.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your stomach's so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:05.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to have a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.35,0:09:06.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very shortly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:10.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a big fuss inside my tummy saying "I want to come out soon!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:12.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:12.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:14.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.52,0:09:15.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina wants to feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.24,0:09:18.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Nina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.17,0:09:21.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.26,0:09:24.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible! Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.10,0:09:38.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay then, does anyone want refills on their tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:40.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.73,0:09:43.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gracia!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:46.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honey, {\i1}uma{\i0}—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:47.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Uma{\i0}? [horse]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:48.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Umareru{\i0}! [the baby's coming]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.44,0:09:51.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It can't be...! \NThe due date isn't here yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:54.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, the baby wants to come out already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.66,0:09:56.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A doctor! \NWe have to get to a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:00.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-There's a blizzard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:04.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll bring a doctor here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:05.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sit tight, Gracia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:07.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,J-Just a sec—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:11.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:13.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gracia-san, I brought some hot water!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.24,0:10:17.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you. \NSet it there on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:18.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:21.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let' see... I suppose \Nwe'll need a lot of towels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.43,0:10:23.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Towels, you say? All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:37.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The doctor sure is taking a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:39.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, with all this snow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:42.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't take any more! I'm dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:46.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! Gracia-san said she's going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.83,0:10:47.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sh-She couldn't be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:54.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's not dead, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:54.04,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Mama-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.04,0:10:56.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You idiot! She's just lost consciousness, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.13,0:10:58.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if you think about it like alchemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:11:01.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there's a considerable cost in creating a new life!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:03.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Childbirth isn't alchemy, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.47,0:11:09.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank goodness she's alive! Are you all right, Gracia-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:16.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit, what should we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:18.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can there be nothing \Nwe can do at a time like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.70,0:11:20.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.56,0:11:22.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the water is cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.34,0:11:25.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.45,0:11:30.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! What did you just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.41,0:11:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:34.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing? But where's the transmutation circle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:37.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then how did the water get hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:40.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How would I know?! \NMust've been force of mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:43.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:48.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:53.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Isn't the doctor here yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:04.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Outstanding! Outstanding, Gracia!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.48,0:12:10.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.24,0:12:13.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:16.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-We didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.54,0:12:19.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:21.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You stayed at my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.95,0:12:37.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This alchemy stuff—turns out it wasn't any help at all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.48,0:12:41.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In contrast, mothers are \Nsomething awesome, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They can do something an alchemist wouldn't be able to do in a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:49.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same goes for our mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:53.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.68,0:13:01.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I was that warm and soft when I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:03.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Of course you were!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:05.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.56,0:13:22.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that, we became \Nmuch more absorbed in alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:26.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was all we could do, wishing to take back the bodies we were born with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you heated that water before without using a transmutation circle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:41.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That situation was something out of the ordinary, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:45.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, it was still \Nincredible of you, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:46.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll have to keep at it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:49.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Well then, I'll quiz you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The test was drawing ever nearer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:14:03.92,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Every year, the test is held in the order of written exam, then interview, and then practical skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:06.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't say anything about \Nhow many people will be taking it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.60,0:14:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but each year, there are only one or two people who pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean, that's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, what kind of things do they do during the interview?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:19.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In my case, all they did was a question-and-answer session,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:22.80,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,but I understand that there are also physical examinations, depending on the person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:26.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A physical examination, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.88,0:14:27.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And another thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:29.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the practical skills test,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:32.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,about half the people brought the results of their research, like I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:36.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and about half showed off \Ntheir transmuting on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:38.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you guys going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:45.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm at a loss. What are we going \Nto do for the practical skills test?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.73,0:14:49.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if they do a physical exam before then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.35,0:14:51.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll find out that the inside of this armor is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:57.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm sure that Lt. Col. Mustang is thinking up something for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:59.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I sure hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:05.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As we embraced our uneasiness, the day of the test finally came.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:24.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will now begin the \Npreliminary examination.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.65,0:15:25.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:42.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brothers! How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.37,0:15:45.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't make it to the last question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.31,0:15:48.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got through all of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but next comes the interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.22,0:15:57.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never would've expected the younger brother to pass the written too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.68,0:15:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The interview...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:09.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.96,0:16:11.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:15.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why? Why would you tell me \Nnot to go through the interview?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.47,0:16:17.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you wish to go any further \Nwhile still concealing your past,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:18.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that's the only thing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.95,0:16:21.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I want to stay together with my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.51,0:16:23.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like Old Lady Pinako said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:30.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,State Alchemists get rounded up \Nwhenever war breaks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.27,0:16:33.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sometimes they have to use \Ntheir alchemy to harm others
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:35.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for the good of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.98,0:16:39.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Passing equals "dog of the military."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:40.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But still!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.22,0:16:44.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be enough for me alone \Nto become a State Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.44,0:16:48.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure I become one and grant you your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:53.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.15,0:17:15.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A golden three-legged stool? \NWhy doesn't it fall over like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.56,0:17:19.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a seat. If you are a true alchemist,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.72,0:17:21.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the chair will not refuse you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:25.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alchemist, at no time \Nallow yourself to be afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.65,0:17:34.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.90,0:17:38.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So then, let's hear your \Nmotivations for taking the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:41.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:45.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's because...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.40,0:17:53.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.34,0:17:57.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told the only other \Nmember of my family
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.34,0:17:59.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I would make sure \NI became a State Alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:07.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.39,0:18:11.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We chose the right path, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:17.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know. But the one thing \NI am sure about...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:20.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is that I want to touch you once again, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.88,0:18:23.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's strange, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.88,0:18:26.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we are, always so near each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.34,0:18:29.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I can't even remember \Nwhat it feels like to touch you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:31.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or the warmth of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.46,0:18:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then, the morning \Nof the practical skills test...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.50,0:18:40.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:42.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.31,0:18:46.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:51.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brother, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.18,0:18:59.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an incantation \Nto grant your wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.08,0:19:02.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Nina!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:21.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We now offer you all of the matter that exists within these premises.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:27.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please make use of it to \Ntransmute whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:29.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever I like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.98,0:19:32.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What on earth should I do in order to pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.85,0:19:49.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is a magnificent article,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.56,0:19:52.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but the fact that he's used up all of his strength is, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:54.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.12,0:19:55.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go next.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:01.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Trees and water?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.60,0:20:08.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope Big Brother is all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:11.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He has your incantation, Nina, so he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:20.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:24.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He made paper and hydrogen \Nout of the wood and water, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:16.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So he can do it without a transmutation circle...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.20,0:21:20.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An underage alchemist, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.67,0:21:22.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Intriguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.93,0:21:32.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow! How amazingly beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.72,0:21:54.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.79,0:21:59.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stop all my wavering!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.39,0:22:01.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to just look straight ahead \Nand race forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:05.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I dead-end, I'll cross that bridge when I come to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.84,0:22:09.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someday, no matter what,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.88,0:22:11.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to return you \Nback to the way you were!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.48,0:22:17.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you do, Brother, \N{\i1}your{\i0} body will be there with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.25,0:23:42.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.26,0:23:45.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 7: "Night of the Chimera's Cry"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:48.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina...
